sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant R as files route
  participant F as fileType.ts
  participant Q as queries.recordUpload
  participant DB as Postgres

  B->>R: multipart file + projectId or conversationId
  R->>R: workspaceAdmin · 404 unless admin
  R->>R: larger than the largest per-type limit · 413
  R->>F: detectFileType(bytes)
  alt not PDF, PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP or UTF-8 text
    R-->>B: 415 · unsupported
  end
  R->>Q: recordUpload with the kind and type found in the bytes
  Note right of Q: one destination · allowlist · not empty<br/>per-type limit 413 · filename cleaned · SHA-256
  Q->>DB: BEGIN
  Q->>DB: current disclosure version accepted? else 409
  Q->>DB: pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtextextended('ai_workspace_storage:' + userId, 0))
  Q->>DB: destination owned and not archived? else 404 or 409
  Q->>DB: same SHA-256 live in the same place? return it · reused
  Q->>DB: SUM of live byte_size · over quota 413 · rollback
  Q->>DB: INSERT ai_files · COMMIT
  R-->>B: file metadata and storage used, never the bytes
